{
  "id": "ss.relic.wand",
  "name": "Spitting maw",
  "description": "A maw hinged open with the acid already leaving it: two mandibles curved back off the jaw, the throat lit behind them, and three globs of `ss.proj.bolt` on their way out. The stat adds a glob and speeds every one of them, and a mouth mid-spit is both at once. Polish: ink underlays added under both mandibles and under each glob (the bolt's own skin is scaled below a pixel here, so an ink teardrop sits behind each glob — full margin round the head, tapering with the thread, and the big one's stops at the lip line so nothing dark spikes into the throat), and the lips split by light — upper `$husk.light`, lower `$husk.dark` — so the maw reads as a jaw at 1× rather than two pale strokes. Glob count, sizes and directions are unchanged.",
